* The best-selling video game in 2023 was ''[[Hogwarts Legacy]]''.<ref>{{Cite news |last=Morris |first=Chris |date=18 January 2024 |title=For the first time since 2008, the best-selling game wasn't 'Call of Duty' or a Rockstar Games title |url=https://www.fastcompany.com/91013150/best-selling-video-game-year-2023-hogwarts-legacy |work=[[Fast Company]]}}</ref>
